   "params": {
    "text": "Deck A and Deck B: ten looks each, a tenth of the slider apart -\n  1 Clean  2 Neon Edges  3 Mosaic  4 Thermal  5 Halftone\n  6 Chroma Split  7 Melt  8 Motion Trails  9 Imprint  10 Follow Spot\n(slider 0, 26, 51, 77, 102, 128, 153, 179, 204, 230). A - B crossfades; Auto mix on the bar swings it to the other deck every four beats; Shuffle looks gives each deck a random look as the mix leaves it, so it comes back as something new - both on, it runs a show by itself. Every look is a sub-graph: Tab enters one."
